IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ho una bella notizia! Ho trovato
{{TAG:000E:0001:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
che stavi cercando, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0008:0005:050000000A002800}}
Cosa?
Non cercavo niente!

{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Sai che stanotte ho sognato
di partecipare a un torneo
di {{TAG:0005:0011:0000}} in{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}. sauna!
{{TAG:0003:0022:}}Ero quasi del tutto disidratato,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
quand'ecco che sei arrivat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} tu{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
e mi hai tirato un secchio d'acqua!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mi hai salvato la vita!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ecco {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
per ringraziarti, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Como eres tan maj{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}, solo quería
mostrarte mi agradecimiento.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Aquí tienes, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Je voulais te remercier d'être
toujours là quand j'ai besoin de toi.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Prends ça, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Du hilfst mir immer und deshalb
wollte ich mich bedanken.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hier, nimm schon, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Benim için hep bir şeyler yapıyorsun;
ben de teşekkürümü göstermek istedim.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Al
bakalım, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Jetzt kannst du endlich einen Haken
auf deinem geheimen Wunschzettel
machen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
